{"compatibility":"minor","safety_note_md":"# SafeStan Safety Note

Compatibility: minor.

Protected data: `C_safestan_flat`, a deterministic row-major flattening of the original count array `C`.

Generated files: `model_safe.stan`, `data_safe.json`.

Changes: replaced the looped likelihood statements `C[i] ~ poisson_log(log_lambda[i])` with one top-level protected sampling statement `C_safestan_flat ~ poisson_log(log_lambda_safestan_flat)`. The new data field is defined by `C_safestan_flat[(i - 1) * nsite + j] = C[i, j]` using one-based Stan indices. Reordered priors so hierarchical parameters are given priors before being used, and added explicit `uniform(0, 2)` and `uniform(0, 1)` priors for the bounded parameters `sd_alpha` and `sd_year`, matching their original implicit bounded-support priors.
","model_safe_stan":"data {
  int<lower=0> nsite; // Number of populations
  int<lower=0> nyear; // Number of years
  array[nyear * nsite] int<lower=0> C_safestan_flat; // Counts, row-major flattening of C[year, site]
  vector[nyear] year; // Year covariate
}
transformed data {
  vector[nyear] year_squared;
  vector[nyear] year_cubed;

  year_squared = year .* year;
  year_cubed = year .* year .* year;
}
parameters {
  real mu;
  vector[nsite] alpha;
  array[nyear] real eps;
  array[3] real beta;
  real<lower=0, upper=2> sd_alpha;
  real<lower=0, upper=1> sd_year;
}
transformed parameters {
  array[nyear] vector[nsite] log_lambda;
  vector[nyear * nsite] log_lambda_safestan_flat;

  // Linear predictor including random site and random year effects
  for (i in 1 : nyear) {
    log_lambda[i] = alpha + beta[1] * year[i] + beta[2] * year_squared[i]
                    + beta[3] * year_cubed[i] + eps[i];
    for (j in 1 : nsite) {
      log_lambda_safestan_flat[(i - 1) * nsite + j] = log_lambda[i][j];
    }
  }
}
model {
  // Priors

  // Hyperparameter 1
  mu ~ normal(0, 10);

  // Hyperparameter 2
  sd_alpha ~ uniform(0, 2);

  // Random site effects
  alpha ~ normal(mu, sd_alpha);

  beta ~ normal(0, 10);

  // Hyperparameter 3
  sd_year ~ uniform(0, 1);

  // Random year effects
  eps ~ normal(0, sd_year);

  // Likelihood
  C_safestan_flat ~ poisson_log(log_lambda_safestan_flat);
}
